<![CDATA[As promised, attached you will find a few example properties from each of our markets. We are EXTREMELY conservative with our ROI calculations, and I have included a word doc that covers the areas in which we are extremely conservative to give you some context in that regard.<br><br>Also, <a data-cke-saved-href="https://na45.salesforce.com/sfc/p/#30000000pfXl/a/3A000000A7hq/9busvd9UvTYXVbEwt_TpECkeBzTbnwp2qFMzdRF1q9I" href="https://na45.salesforce.com/sfc/p/#30000000pfXl/a/3A000000A7hq/9busvd9UvTYXVbEwt_TpECkeBzTbnwp2qFMzdRF1q9I">here is a link you can use to review our company performance data</a> &nbsp;as well as more info about the markets in which we invest.<br><br>Please let me know once you are ready to have a second call to help you move forward.<br><br>Thanks,<br><br>Ben<br><div><br></div><div><img width="420" data-cke-saved-src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fi-LvmCPc1FD5qVWvWfrNoRO4OAiBv25_uWmcO7xwevrKELZPSjGC1sZXXSf6mwwiMNek6vo6IfH8RgtyVdvlbKj_735C655NWf7rozMbQLUtg0lA290uVTUhAwwAseeaN9Upynq3iZTsz0o9MDXSF4ClHAlw1n-B4lYRBII15WHSrFQ2X-OG_b4Md1E0oW9i8dBNOytwB6FYOeqeg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1dmYHwbBZppSiVLTErHMsgORMSrHoT9sU&amp;revid=0B09QfomT_h2yclNneTZHT2ZMQUdzU09qZ2VvTCt1K1F0Unc0PQ" src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Fi-LvmCPc1FD5qVWvWfrNoRO4OAiBv25_uWmcO7xwevrKELZPSjGC1sZXXSf6mwwiMNek6vo6IfH8RgtyVdvlbKj_735C655NWf7rozMbQLUtg0lA290uVTUhAwwAseeaN9Upynq3iZTsz0o9MDXSF4ClHAlw1n-B4lYRBII15WHSrFQ2X-OG_b4Md1E0oW9i8dBNOytwB6FYOeqeg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1dmYHwbBZppSiVLTErHMsgORMSrHoT9sU&amp;revid=0B09QfomT_h2yclNneTZHT2ZMQUdzU09qZ2VvTCt1K1F0Unc0PQ" height="256"></div>]]></td>
